;; Card fb183e73: a bare body in water with a drowned near swims to the nearest seen dry stand (cornered option :swim-out, first in the order)
;; instead of fist-fighting it. Stone block x 3..30, z 9..23, y 0..2 (top feet y 3) with a lake carved in it, x 4..14, z 10..22, water y 0..2 (the surface is
;; level with the shore). The drowned is NoAI and helmeted (it never hurts, no sun burn) and stands beside the body.
;; The :swim-out step itself is pinned by cornered-test (a-bare-body-in-water-with-a-drowned-beside-it-swims-to-dry-land...); live the body leaves by an ordinary flee step.
;; Should-succeed: the bare body leaves the water (by a flee step or the cornered swim-out) and never fights the drowned (still alive).
;; Should-fail (control): with an iron sword the fight wins, so the body kills it and does not take the swim-out step.
{:defaults
 {:tags [:hostile :survival :cornered :water]
  :time :any
  :register [{:trigger :hostile-near :args {:radius 8 :ranged-radius 16}
              :job (jobs.survival.respond-to-hostile)}]
  :blocks [[:fill [3 0 9] [30 2 23] "stone"]
           [:fill [4 0 10] [14 2 22] "water"]]
  :body {:at [8.5 1 16.5] :effects [["resistance" 600 4]]}
  :limit-s 90}
 :cases
 [{:name "bare-body-swims-to-the-shore-and-does-not-fight"
   :act [[:summon "drowned" [9.5 1 16.5] "{NoAI:1b,equipment:{head:{id:\"minecraft:iron_helmet\",count:1}}}"]
         [:wait-s 12]] ; hold: the body takes this long to leave the water
   :after [[:body-far [8.5 1 16.5] 3] [:entities "type=drowned,tag=wt" [[3 0 9] [30 6 23]] 1]]
   :limit-s 60}
  {:name "armed-body-that-wins-fights-instead-of-swimming-out"
   :body {:inventory [["iron_sword" 1]]}
   :act [[:summon "drowned" [9.5 1 16.5] "{NoAI:1b,equipment:{head:{id:\"minecraft:iron_helmet\",count:1}}}"]]
   :expect [{:no-event {:source :job :kind :retreat.step-speed :data {:slot :dry}} :for-s 40}]
   :after [[:entities "type=drowned,tag=wt" [[3 0 9] [30 6 23]] 0]]
   :limit-s 60}]}
